# OPTIONAL protected credential file. Copy to credentials.env and chmod 600
# ONLY if you must push over HTTPS instead of SSH.
#
# The default publish path is SSH (git@github.com) with the gh keyring token,
# so no token is required and this file normally does not exist.
#
# Never commit this file. Never put the token in the repo, the Git remote URL,
# a prompt, a hook, or logs. The helper reads GH_TOKEN only from the process
# environment and uses a throwaway askpass helper for the push.
#
# GH_TOKEN=REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TOKEN
